(text "Chip end CLCCL: C426/L403/C427, followed by R416 (series cap tuning site, initially 0 ohm) and L406 (shunt inductor, initially DNP). Use the RF stub." (at 16 104.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 3121153b-d910-5c58-9a82-c9c237ab20bb))
(text "Follow with 50 ohm grounded coplanar waveguide over a continuous reference plane. Populate the Johanson series/shunt/series antenna tee close to ANT401." (at 16 109.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid cfc58896-afd2-52e2-b11f-4312283d9655))
(text "Reserve 6.5 x 6.5 mm of all-layer antenna ground clearance at a corner per the Johanson mounting drawing. Solder both terminals. Pin 2 has no electrical connection." (at 16 114.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 6037044f-c0d5-5658-ba2e-08616174d054))
(text "Initial match values come from two manufacturers on their reference boards. Tune both ends and test spurious emissions, range and loaded S11 with the LAB display and pack installed." (at 16 119.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 6963144e-01e7-5c7c-82fb-4b02ec6dd0bc))
